An append onto a null key turns it into a one-element list and prints the diff.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Probe plan
sessions: null
---

Body.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md --append sessions=abc-123
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 ---
 title: Probe plan
-sessions: null
+sessions:
+- abc-123
 ---
 
 Body.
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: sessions+=abc-123
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Probe plan
sessions:
- abc-123
---

Body.
-- exit --
0
